            <ArticleTitle>Giant cell tumour of the patellar tendon sheath--an unusual cause of anterior knee pain: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>145-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of a giant cell tumour of the patellar tendon sheath with anterior knee pain. The relevant MRI findings and differential diagnosis of such lesions is discussed here.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
